{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 37, :comments ["<b>Its lamps.</b> Like cups in which one places the oil and the wicks." "<b>And it shall give light over against its face.</b> Make the openings of the six lamps that are at the heads of the branches coming out from its sides turned toward the central one, so that when you kindle the lamps they give light toward its face — their light turned toward the side of the face of the central branch, which is the body of the menorah."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:54:33.837456559Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}